1
00:00:01,524 --> 00:00:02,790
As the punch comes in,

2
00:00:02,791 --> 00:00:05,433
move diagonally backwards 
controlling the punch

3
00:00:06,334 --> 00:00:07,544
raise his arm up,

4
00:00:08,445 --> 00:00:10,902
step in deeply with your hands around his waist,

5
00:00:10,903 --> 00:00:12,553
dropping your center below his waist,

6
00:00:12,554 --> 00:00:14,358
taking him over your body for the throw.

